Copyright (c) 2026 Buntos <324143321+buntatoes@users.noreply.github.com>

This repository uses a Three-Tier Split License Architecture separating the
Permissive Rendering/Scripting Engine (`Apache-2.0`), the Hardcoded Security
Sandbox, Shield & Application Layer (`LicenseRef-Proprietary`), and the
Standalone Companion Libraries (`MPL-2.0`):

------------------------------------------------------------------------
PART I: PERMISSIVE ENGINE TIER (Apache License, Version 2.0)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Applies to:
- `crates/flux-dom` (HTML parser & bounded DOM tree)
- `crates/flux-style` (CSS parser & specificity cascade)
- `crates/flux-layout` (Block, Inline, Flexbox, & Table layout engine)
- `crates/flux-paint` (Display list generation & viewport scaling)
- `crates/flux-raster` (RGBA framebuffer & C++20 SIMD/SDF raster kernel)
- `crates/flux-script` (JavaScript runtime & C++20 JIT bytecode compiler)

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "Apache License");
