PART II: HARDCODED SECURITY, SANDBOX, SHIELD & APPLICATION TIER
         (Proprietary — All Rights Reserved)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Applies to:
- `crates/flux-sandbox` (Mandatory OS process isolation & job-object guard)
- `crates/flux-net` (Pre-Socket Tracker/Ad/Malware Shield, HSTS, FIPS 180-4
  SHA-256 Subresource Integrity, CSP, CORP, RFC 6265bis CookieJar, & TLS)
- `crates/flux-browser` (Windows DPAPI `profile.flx` encryption, SHA-256
  Download Verifier & Quarantine, UI shell, installer, and `flux.exe` /
  `FluxBrowser-Setup` compiled binaries)
- `assets/flux-logo.png` (Official Flux Browser Brand Emblem)

1. Ownership: All files, security policies, cryptographic containers, and
   compiled binaries in Part II are the sole and exclusive proprietary
   property of Buntos. All Rights Reserved.
2. Restrictions: Except for running the unmodified compiled Flux Browser
   application or inspecting the source code for security verification, no
   license or right is granted to redistribute, rebrand, sublicense, or
   create commercial derivative works of the Part II Proprietary Security
   and Application components without prior written permission from Buntos.

